TI ipc perf
Pre-requisite: Need to load ipc echo test firmware image to remote cores.

Options:
     -v Get more verbose logs on the message sent and received.
     -s skip a pre-defined list of remote cores. This is needed for the standard
        configuration that we support on QNX where the MCU1_0 and MCU1_1 run
        DM firmware.
     -n Number of messages to be exchanged between A72 and each remote core.
     -c Run the perf for a single core
     -m message size (Not implemented yet)

Note:
    In case the remote cores are not loaded, the test is blocked since it is waiting
